{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eXeVciCIyw2BLS-egOBaOw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:45.162636+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eXeVciCIyw2BLS-egOBaOw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTVichQh4eyGonGNficLH40zQjh4GJibu9aye5ZvIaSqPia025ic3EeCuHG2w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院概况</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTnpDIPoDfJaArpmQXdM2sut2Vy9YXhkTxytNFJYjxr1YheiaSFMvS4gQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>材料科学与工程学院/格莱特研究院与学校同源共进，历经七十余年发展已成为国内材料领域创新高地。学院以服务国家战略需求为己任，秉承“诚信、严谨、挑战、创新”的院训，是学校高层次人才比例最高、学科实力卓越、科研成果丰硕、人才培养成效显著的学院。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTn1xTKkGicCTIEuDntY2HxWBhmEKKKHttXVUoHBIEOicCmPqBr1xt9sUg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院以“国之重器”为使命担当，铸就材料强国战略支点，聚焦航空发动机材料、高端智能制造装备、半导体芯片材料、纳米能源等战略前沿领域，以高端材料科学研究助力国家科技战略实力跃升，形成了学科底蕴强、人才实力强、创新平台强、科研支撑强、国际视野强、育人成效强的鲜明特色。</span><strong><span><span>目前学院的研究生都在南京校区培养</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.1 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学科底蕴强</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院始建于1953年新中国军工科技最高学府——中国人民解放军军事工程学院（简称“哈军工”）金工金相教研室，1981年获批全国首批博士点，2001年“材料学”获批国家重点学科（江苏唯一），学科还是两化融合重点学科、国防特色学科，学科软科排名全国前20位，ESI排名位列全球前0.56‰，跻身全球顶尖学科行列。</span><span><span> </span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTns9J0fic4yLh22L33oUvvPx5pLG1bMibbyhrZNeh7VekcNtfAicL77eXg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.2 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人才实力强</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院拥有一支由战略科学家引领、领军人才掌舵、青年人才支撑的高水平人才队伍。现有教职工175人，其中国内外院士4人，国家教学名师1人，国家级领军人才7人，何梁何利奖1人，全国创新争先奖2人，国家百千万人才1人，国家级青年人才23人，省部级创新团队5个，国家级人才师资占比30%，创新能力显著增强，先后在《Science》《Nature》发表正刊2篇、子刊28篇。</span><span><span> </span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTmJFyVU4dibeBBamXGaBTMysh4f1eAQicvPFlXCaWUPhicC8iaua3J8SMSQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeT1OSIntjYtAjCUKbgFpBibWRq9O1JFsdeOR7FfbFJrhra6FHCLz7lP7g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTcBqjYsoxO3uZ6X7Jbl5fwqYqkDAk7pT5lvGU6nLuibUJMxyrKbicoeMQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTZ0xUZ7Y2nzSzmY2fmzeYVRfFwQbibsRW1psFMO9zP40ZpVY4hvd90jQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.3 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>创新平台强</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院建有微纳米材料与技术国际联合研究中心、高端装备铸造技术全国重点实验室、特种车辆设计制造集成技术全国重点实验室三个国家级科研平台，10个省部级科研平台。强化“科教融合，立德树人”特色，将科研平台全面融入本科专业，通过科研训练等，全面提升学生的科研认知和动手能力，培养下一代“陆战平台等陆海空天信”的大国工匠。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTb0tttyFXjaB9vz5S90nx4VeLWoSRgnyAhtlib9Vp7pYy4RwaJsMKdCA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.4 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>战略支撑强</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院承担了国家重点研发计划、前沿创新重大项目等一大批高层次科研项目，形成了高性能金属材料及加工、电弧增材与智能制造、光电显示材料与器件、纳米及能源材料等特色研究方向。先后荣获国家技术发明二等奖2项、国家科学技术进步二等奖1项、中国专利金奖1项、中国国际科学技术合作奖1项、省部级科技一等奖12项、国防科技十大进展1项。近年来，科研经费年均近2亿元。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTWE81ibUGA9klTOBV6zSpGFXCUxnkhr8icKm5S8wlicogicCdyWg1BHN6ag/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeToQ9mxtwQVabULTW5IdAlJMFRsjnjM3nYLAM4m6O6GSEGGhShjAs6iaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span> </span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.5 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>国际视野强</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院坚持国际化开放办学，引进德国科学院院士3人，打造了纳米材料顶级科研平台——格莱特纳米科技研究所，并与德国卡尔斯鲁厄理工学院、德国明斯特大学、美国北卡罗莱纳州立大学、俄罗斯乌法国立航空技术大学、澳大利亚悉尼大学、香港城市大学、日本东北大学等10多个国家30多所大学、研究机构建立了学术合作关系，学生可以通过暑期学校、外教上课、学术讲座、高水平国际会议与全球大师交流学习，还有机会赴德国、日本等材料名校深度游学，拓展学术视野与国际视野。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTdicKUbdArZZPhy9rQoeREFwViaPkOc2cTEc4YD5oQGRbt1w2tBLoia0YA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeT7ZW5zgw6PLu2zU3ibzsuHpWib2CCwRodBiaRfdKCWnXzHn0PMWib0qkibHQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开放日</span></strong><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTnpDIPoDfJaArpmQXdM2sut2Vy9YXhkTxytNFJYjxr1YheiaSFMvS4gQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>80人</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上线下相结合</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2025年7月16日-7月21日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2026年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业为</span><strong><span><span>材料科学与工程</span></span></strong><span>及相近专业，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过</span><strong><span><span>邮件</span></span></strong><span>方式进行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1） 申请表</span></p><p><span>（2） 个人陈述</span></p><p><span>（3） 本人居民身份证和学生证复印件。</span></p><p><span>（4） 由教务处或所在院系开具的现有本科阶段成绩单与专业总评成绩排名证明（须学校教务部门或学院盖章）。</span></p><p><span>（5） 外语水平证明（如CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等的证书或成绩单）。</span></p><p><span>（6） 其它能证明本人成绩及潜力的材料，如校级及以上获奖证书、公开发表的学术论文、资格证书等复印件。</span></p><p><span>请申请人将以上材料</span><strong><span><span>按序号整理排序</span></span></strong><span>，放在一个PDF中，要求</span><strong><span><span>有目录、页数和页眉</span></span></strong><span>，在</span><strong><span><span>每一页的右上角页眉处做好内容标记</span></span></strong><span>，方便专家查看。</span></p><p><span>PDF命名方式：</span><strong><span><span>校园开放日2025申请资料-本科院校名称-姓名</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>PDF文件需压缩后，在</span><strong><span><span>7月21日17:00前</span></span></strong><span>发送至邮箱</span><strong><span><span>yz116@njust.edu.cn</span></span></strong><span>，请勿重复发送。</span></p><p><span>所提交的材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消申请资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院将利用线上资源开展政策宣讲、专家报告、师生研讨、师生互动沙龙及研究生座谈等多形式的活动。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTMfhklaiajlL1FKPuKD0TaIO9dXa1RGb3RjcxjIKsiczKku1QwibnyMNiag/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系人：蒋尧、梁斐</span></p><p><span>联系电话：025-84314985、18130130993</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：yz116@njust.edu.cn、fliang@njust.edu.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTiaUdr2ZicQFwpbG1CNNzrdNZr2qcpCxy72XzSVzFgiaCJibpibqZRSRNbog/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>QQ群（1049282744）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTEWLbPZJY4zSypzS8zUhbl5tibuYpkAj3VhTRwsDpUJhXw1VUbqFeAXw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>南理工研招公众号</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTP1jiaTc0zn4ic1SOUPML4ez7ibicLpq3u1JfibYZLgJbNjNJzic3lpNRibemQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>南理工材料院公众号</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTwb0O6EEqu7MVSfcibQsnicX0EoCOqxpVlOZzxQ6qRL6icpegicFgmc4eRA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>学院导师公众号</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTRDfumm6bDutt11SIDicIibsrzEj3aBpia0dEGf2DtP2g1KK3PDJmyVuGg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 材料科学与工程学院</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 代芳冰</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华 材料科学与工程学院</span></p><p><span>审核 | 齐玉辉</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"1a8902318ae17e7d314440c4e9d9a8de44d8fe33bc42174e401d73889780e069","textLength":2124,"sourceSha256":"f3e25240a09978c789739e57ded5e99725bf2d3768bfaf911c01b9c09d99b582","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5f1b654157a2116e1f6e","title":"2025年南京理工大学材料科学与工程学院2025年校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:45.162636+00:00"}
